  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 503.02 Simplified Inundation Map",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 503.02 Simplified Inundation Map.\n\n(a) An owner who has been exempted from the requirement of a breach analysis pursuant to Env-Wr 502.02 shall submit a simplified inundation map.\n\n(b) The simplified inundation map shall include the elements specified in Env-Wr 503.01(a), (c)(1) - (3), (c)(7), and (c)(9).\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
